        "Content": "Luxurious 3 Bedroom Apartment in a Magical Coastal Setting"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "The spacious residence is nicely tucked away from the hustle and bustle of the Main Street, being one of 6 units.\r\nBuilt c.1990,, as part of the Pier View Development, No.5 is one of the bigger units, being 3 Bedroom as opposed to 2 Bedroom.. \r\nThe Living/Dining, Sitting space are both large and generous,c. 40 mts. the sleeping quarters 2 Double Bedrooms ( main - en - suite) one Single Bedroom) face on to an open courtyard, yet still offer great privacy. \r\nExiting through a private wrought iron gateway, accessed by residents/ key code available only, step right on to the busy footpath during the peak Summer months, or alternatively, stroll to the village centre and all it's amenities , meet friends and neighbours during the lazy Winter months.\r\nTake your daily exercise, walk /jog the very popular, much used, walkway from Timoleague to Courtmacsherry \r\nCatch the Western setting sun while taking a stroll on the Pier, 50 mts.away, before settling in for the night,,absolute heaven !\r\nThe garden to the rear, little maintenance needed  great privacy, and room for storage of bikes, paddle boards,dinghies etc.\r\nCourtmacsherry being one of the few remaining un- spoilt villages of The Wild Atlantic Way.,\r\nThere are four beaches within a 10 minute drive of Courtmacsherry, together with a variety of walks, Seven Heads Walk, Fuschia Walk, etc.\r\nDrive The Wild Atlantic Way, numerous towns and villages waiting to be explored, Cork City/ Airport is a 40 minute drive.  \r\nThis property would make a ideal Summer home, a lovely permanent home in which to live all year round, an investment property\r\nServices : Mains Sewage, Mains Water, OFCH, Electric Radiators, Stove,\r\nDisclaimer: All information provided is to the best of our knowledge but is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No warranties or representations are made regarding the accuracy, completeness, condition or planning status of the property. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of all information provided, including measurements, boundaries, size or acreage, BER details and services. All measurements and distances are approximate and for guidance only. Photographs and video are for illustrative purposes and may include items not included in the sale (e.g. furniture)."
      },
